Code segment : 
--->contains teh compiled BYTECODE( machine code) of the Java program
--->Its read only

Data Segment :
--->Contains all the static and global variables
--->threads can read and modify the same data
--->Synchronization is required between the threads

Heap:
--->Objects created at runtime using new Keyword are allocated 
--->heap is shared among all teh threads 
of the same process. (but NOT within the processes)
---> threads can read adn modift the heap data


